/Title (The plaintext is written in rows under a keyword. The columns are then read out in the alphabetical order of the keyword's letters to form the ciphertext. Padding \('X'\) is added so the grid is rectangular. Decryption rebuilds the grid column by column in that same key order, then reads it row by row.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 348 0 R
>>
